  "details": "It seems to be if group has certain number of members, group push notification made by group owner not works.\n\nIt push notified to browser and can check record on in-game annoucement page but not push notified in-game.\n\n.\n\n.\n\n.\n\n.\n\nGroup which has issue,\n\nVRCラジオ体操 (634 members)\n\ngrp_48cb56d0-3f8d-4177-bcea-252d03726b42\n\n(confirmed with owner few times and not managed to get any notification if done by owner)\n\n.\n\n.\n\n.\n\nOpen Beta (1750 members)\n\n(as not received notification earlier today on 19th October)\n\ngrp_34e02a44-ca82-458f-904b-9a4b20869c77\n\n.\n\n.\n\n.\n\n.\n\nI can confirm this issue not happe with member count around 100 with following group.\n\nVRCβフォース\n\ngrp_73e6b80e-bf98-4b26-8a9b-c9558a9c321f",
